>\n<div class=\"sec-item\">\n<strong>Error handling:</strong> Graceful degradation\n</div>\n<div class=\"sec-item\">\n<strong>Monitoring:</strong> Track performance and errors\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"hub-section\">\n<div class=\"section-header\">\n<h2>📦 Deployment & Operations</h2>\n<span class=\"section-badge\">DevOps</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"section-desc\">Deploy, monitor, and maintain AI systems in production</p>\n<div class=\"feature-grid\">\n<div class=\"feature-card\">\n<div class=\"feature-icon\">🐳</div>\n<h3>Containerization</h3>\n<p>Docker and Kubernetes patterns for AI workloads</p>\n<div class=\"feature-tags\">\n<span class=\"tag\">Docker</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">K8s</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">GPU</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"command-list\">\n<code># Example Dockerfile</code>\n<code>FROM nvidia/cuda:12.0-runtime</code>\n<code>RUN pip install transformers</code>\n<code>COPY . /app</code>\n<code>CMD [\"python\", \"serve.py\"]</code>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"feature-card\">\n<div class=\"feature-icon\">📊</div>\n<h3>Monitoring & Observability</h3>\n<p>Track performance, costs, and user experience</p>\n<div class=\"feature-tags\">\n<span class=\"tag\">Metrics</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Logging</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Tracing</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"monitor-list\">\n<div class=\"mon-item\">\n✅ Latency tracking\n</div>\n<div class=\"mon-item\">\n✅ Token usage\n</div>\n<div class=\"mon-item\">\n✅ Error rates\n</div>\n<div class=\"mon-item\">\n✅ Cost monitoring\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"feature-card\">\n<div class=\"feature-icon\">🔄</div>\n<h3>CI/CD for ML</h3>\n<p>Automated testing and deployment for AI systems</p>\n<div class=\"feature-tags\">\n<span class=\"tag\">CI/CD</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Testing</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Automation</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cicd-list\">\n<div class=\"cicd-item\">\n<strong>Model testing:</strong> Regression tests\n</div>\n<div class=\"cicd-item\">\n<strong>Prompt testing:</strong> Output validation\n</div>\n<div class=\"cicd-item\">\n<strong>Load testing:</strong> Performance benchmarks\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"hub-section\">\n<div class=\"section-header\">\n<h2>🎓 Learning Resources</h2>\n<span class=\"section-badge\">Education</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"section-desc\">Technical tutorials, courses, and references for engineers</p>\n<div class=\"feature-grid\">\n<a href=\"learning-paths.html\" class=\"feature-card\">\n<div class=\"feature-icon\">🎓</div>\n<h3>Learning Paths</h3>\n<p>Structured paths for engineers entering AI</p>\n<div class=\"feature-tags\">\n<span class=\"tag\">Beginner</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Advanced</span>\n</div>\n</a>\n<a href=\"resources.html\" class=\"feature-card\">\n<div class=\"feature-icon\">🔗</div>\n<h3>External Resources</h3>\n<p>Curated links to tutorials, courses, and documentation</p>\n<div class=\"feature-tags\">\n<span class=\"tag\">Tutorials</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Courses</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Docs</span>\n</div>\n</a>\n<a href=\"concepts/glossary.html\" class=\"feature-card\">\n<div class=\"feature-icon\">📚</div>\n<h3>Technical Glossary</h3>\n<p>Definitions of AI/ML terms with implementation context</p>\n<div class=\"feature-tags\">\n<span class=\"tag\">Reference</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Technical</span>\n</div>\n</a>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"quick-actions\">\n<h2>⚡ Engineer Quick Actions</h2>\n<div class=\"action-grid\">\n<button class=\"action-btn\" onclick=\"window.location.href='search-papers.html'\">\n<span class=\"action-icon\">🔍</span>\n<span>Find Code</span>\n</button>\n<button class=\"action-btn\" onclick=\"window.location.href='comparison-tables.html'\">\n<span class=\"action-icon\">📊</span>\n<span>Compare</span>\n</button>\n<button class=\"action-btn\" onclick=\"window.location.href='compare-papers.html'\">\n<span class=\"action-icon\">⚖️</span>\n<span>Benchmarks</span>\n</button>\n<